type: software
title: quantlab-factor-agent
abstract: >-
  LLM-driven, mechanism-first mining of stock factors on quantlab: language models
  propose economic mechanisms and the KunQuant code they imply, and fixed checks and
  training-segment statistics decide which factors are new and add to the existing set.
